  "details": "Steps to produce:\n\n1. Launch Unity with 3.7.6 SDK\n\n2. Load your world\n\n3. Upload Android version\n\n4. Test it works = Works\n\n5. Upload iOS vesion\n\n6. Test it works = Works\n\n7. Join again with Android = World will not load nor pre-load\n\nCurrently, the workaround is to upload the Android world again. But this happens always if you upload iOS world right after.\n\nEdit: World ID in question: wrld_6f12cc23-872d-40f1-8c1a-ad1682b92c97",
